OL,3,GNEWSAThousands gather for Last Saturday
OL,4,Aparades across Northern Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of members of the Royal Black
OL,7,FInstitution and supporters are taking
OL,8,Fpart in the organisation's annual Last
OL,9,FSaturday demonstrations across Northern
OL,10,FIreland.
OL,12,FThe parades, which mark the traditional
OL,13,Ffinale of the summer marching season,
OL,14,Fare being held in five locations, with
OL,15,FCounty Down's flagship demonstration
OL,16,Ftaking place in Newry.
OL,18,FAbout 17,000 members and supporters are
OL,19,Fattending events throughout the day,
OL,20,Fwhile 300 marching bands are
OL,21,Fparticipating in parades and
OL,22,Fdemonstrations.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
